OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after police called
OL,4,Ato 'medical emergency' on residential
OL,5,Astreet
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 61-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of murder following a
OL,9,F"medical emergency" in the early hours
OL,10,Fof Sunday morning.
OL,12,FNorth Wales Police said officers were
OL,13,Fcalled at 03:49 GMT to a residential
OL,14,Fproperty on Morawelon Road in Holyhead,
OL,15,Fon Anglesey, by the Welsh Ambulance
OL,16,FService.
OL,18,FDet Insp Rob Mahoney said the force was
OL,19,Ftreating it as an "isolated incident"
OL,20,Fand there was no ongoing threat to the
OL,21,Fwider community.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
